WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.085 --> 00:00:05.180
It was morning in Metro City.

2
00:00:05.181 --> 00:00:09.821
A man rolled out of bed.

3
00:00:09.822 --> 00:00:16.485
He yawned. He looked at his clock and gasped.

4
00:00:16.486 --> 00:00:21.182
"I slept through my alarm! I'll be late for work!"

5
00:00:21.183 --> 00:00:27.042
The man quickly got ready and ran out the door.

6
00:00:27.043 --> 00:00:29.409
He drove through Metro City.

7
00:00:29.410 --> 00:00:35.864
Every traffic light he passed was green.

8
00:00:35.865 --> 00:00:40.851
"Whew!" the man said. "I might not be late after all!"

9
00:00:40.852 --> 00:00:44.550
Suddenly he saw cars stopped in the street.

10
00:00:44.551 --> 00:00:47.587
He slammed on his brakes.

11
00:00:47.588 --> 00:00:50.391
Dance music filled the air.

12
00:00:50.392 --> 00:00:53.302
People were honking their horns and shouting.

13
00:00:53.303 --> 00:00:56.223
"Get out of the way!"

14
00:00:56.224 --> 00:00:59.036
"Quit blocking the road!"

15
00:00:59.037 --> 00:01:01.901
"I'm trying to drive!"

16
00:01:01.902 --> 00:01:05.992
The man got out of his car to see what was going on.

17
00:01:05.993 --> 00:01:12.661
The intersection up ahead was filled with roller skaters!

18
00:01:12.662 --> 00:01:18.396
"Check this out!" Jack was standing on his chair and dancing.

19
00:01:18.397 --> 00:01:22.300
Mara giggled.

20
00:01:22.301 --> 00:01:25.578
"Sit down, Jack!" Terrell whispered.

21
00:01:25.579 --> 00:01:29.228
"You're going to get all of us in trouble."

22
00:01:29.229 --> 00:01:35.846
"Yeah," Roxy said quietly. "We're trying to take a quiz."

23
00:01:35.847 --> 00:01:38.636
"Jack!" Miss Apricot said.

24
00:01:38.637 --> 00:01:43.779
"What are you supposed to be doing right now?"

25
00:01:43.780 --> 00:01:48.264
Jack looked down. "Um, taking a quiz."

26
00:01:48.265 --> 00:01:55.183
"That's right," Miss Apricot said. "Please sit down."

27
00:01:55.184 --> 00:02:00.126
Jack sat down and looked at his quiz.

28
00:02:00.127 --> 00:02:03.713
He spun his pencil around.

29
00:02:03.714 --> 00:02:08.782
Then he picked it up and pretended it was dancing.

30
00:02:08.783 --> 00:02:12.191
"It's a pencil dance party!" Jack whispered.

31
00:02:12.192 --> 00:02:17.681
Mara snorted. Then she made her pencil dance too.

32
00:02:17.682 --> 00:02:21.686
"Jack! Mara!" Miss Apricot said.

33
00:02:21.687 --> 00:02:25.128
"Stop goofing around!"

34
00:02:25.129 --> 00:02:31.428
Jack sighed. "Sorry, Miss Apricot."

35
00:02:31.429 --> 00:02:34.461
"Thanks a lot, Jack," Mara whispered.

36
00:02:34.462 --> 00:02:36.929
"You got me in trouble."

37
00:02:36.930 --> 00:02:42.501
Jack made a face at her. Mara giggled.

38
00:02:42.502 --> 00:02:48.577
Jack groaned. "I wish Rocket Girl could save us from this quiz."

39
00:02:48.578 --> 00:02:54.585
"Shh," Roxy said. "I'm trying to work."

40
00:02:54.586 --> 00:02:58.685
Just then her watch beeped.

41
00:02:58.686 --> 00:03:01.700
"I'll be right back, Miss Apricot," she said.

42
00:03:01.701 --> 00:03:05.760
"I have to, um, get a drink of water!"

43
00:03:05.761 --> 00:03:10.817
Roxy hurried out to the hallway.

44
00:03:10.818 --> 00:03:12.509
She opened her watch.

45
00:03:12.510 --> 00:03:16.925
"Mayor Bloom," Roxy said. "Is something wrong?"

46
00:03:16.926 --> 00:03:21.121
"Sort of." The mayor grinned sheepishly.

47
00:03:21.122 --> 00:03:26.136
"There's a roller-skating party in downtown Metro City."

48
00:03:26.137 --> 00:03:28.377
Roxy scratched her head.

49
00:03:28.378 --> 00:03:32.031
"That doesn't seem like an emergency, Mayor."

50
00:03:32.032 --> 00:03:36.190
"The party is blocking a busy intersection," Mayor Bloom said.

51
00:03:36.191 --> 00:03:39.055
"It's causing a huge traffic jam.

52
00:03:39.056 --> 00:03:42.783
The police tried all morning to make the roller skaters leave.

53
00:03:42.784 --> 00:03:47.512
But they won't listen! Can you please break up the party?"

54
00:03:47.513 --> 00:03:50.069
"Sure, Mayor," Roxy said.

55
00:03:50.070 --> 00:03:53.408
"I'll go and talk to those roller skaters."

56
00:03:53.409 --> 00:03:56.806
Roxy closed her watch and chuckled.

57
00:03:56.807 --> 00:04:02.339
"This will be the easiest mission ever!"

